task: ui-hybrid
agent: fable-frontend
started: 2026-09-09
branch: feature/ui-hybrid
worktree: ../okay-wt-ui-hybrid
spec: specs/frontend.md, stage 2

why: stages 0-1 (f99880f5, d45fba3a) gave the tree its levels and the
  wire its contract; every keystroke still crosses the wire. The
  operator's call: hybrid from the start — no round trip per keystroke.

what: Form joins the level every client draws (the hybrid rule lives
  on it): inputs inside a Form fold on the client, the submit button
  sends ONE Event.Submitted(formKey, json) decoded by the form's
  schema; `live` inputs still send Edited. Claimed Tabs and the new
  Disclosure switch locally. A server SetValue overrides a local edit.
  Forged Submitted (key not a shown Form, or a value the schema
  rejects) never reaches update. Wire.client, live.js, Live.form,
  Form.submitted; the conformance script gains a Submitted.

predict: Event gains a Json-carrying case — Schema[Event] derivation
  needs Schema[Json]; live.js gets a Form case and a submit collector.
